source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
Print the dependency report: duplicates, third-party crates per crate, third-party unsafe counts and code that runs at build time

Usage: cargo xtask deps-report [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --base <commit>
          Only when Cargo.lock changed since <commit>, adding cargo tree -d and unsafe changes

  -h, --help
          Print help
